> Article 50 of the EU AI Act sets transparency obligations that apply regardless of
> whether a system is high-risk. Under the timeline following the Digital Omnibus
> agreement, they apply from **2 August 2026**.
>
> The snippets below are drafting starting points, not legal advice, and not approved
